      propertyPath: text
      value: Who are you?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3483399289043938203, guid: 7c6376aeb2e104c4c85017d27cabf3f2, type: 3}
      propertyPath: reply
      value: Name's Sunak. Unlike my ancestors, I bear the privilege of a name of
        my choosing. We, sundered people, hold the memory of our slave days close
        to our hearts. If you'd like to know more of our history, we have it preserved
        in ink. You are warmly welcomed to explore our treasures of the past.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
