    - target: {fileID: 5136461691029717935, guid: 7c6376aeb2e104c4c85017d27cabf3f2, type: 3}
      propertyPath: text
      value: What can you tell me about Sunkenland?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5136461691029717935, guid: 7c6376aeb2e104c4c85017d27cabf3f2, type: 3}
      propertyPath: reply
      value: "This place languishes in tranquility now, but it was once vibrant with
        golden foliage and the echoes of dwarven laughter. However, this vitality
        came at a cost \u2014 many tears shed on rainy days, unheard in the king's
        towering halls. Sunkenland is a home to the past, offering little welcome
        to the future. Yet, we remain here because no other place would accept us.
        The memories of this place, whether good or bad, form our legacy and our
        calling."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
