    - target: {fileID: 5136461691029717935, guid: 7c6376aeb2e104c4c85017d27cabf3f2, type: 3}
      propertyPath: text
      value: The Hawk Band?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5136461691029717935, guid: 7c6376aeb2e104c4c85017d27cabf3f2, type: 3}
      propertyPath: reply
      value: They're the scoundrels around here. The word is they were formidable
        knights from a faraway land. They came to Ministeria to rally an army and
        reclaim their homeland from its oppressive ruler. But as time went on, no
        one worthy proved a match. They've grown tired of waiting and disillusioned
        in their search. Perhaps you'll be the answer they seek?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
